Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪 你現在緊張嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不愧是仁阪啊 我就沒那麼輕鬆了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己明明沒有出場
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卻沒辦法冷靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:22.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總覺得這次文化祭我完全沒能派上用場
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事到如今 我卻感到有些後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:42.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:49.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:56.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:01:01.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:09.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:15.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:22.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:30.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:37.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:42.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:50.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:56.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一年四班 演出劇目「羅密歐與茱麗葉」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,匯聚了我們全年級最好看的帥哥美女哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十一點半開始 請務必光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做自己不習慣的事情真是太辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什麼 那是什麼服裝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好帥 像女演員一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她穿著羅密歐的衣服 真是又帥氣又漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,男女反轉版「羅密歐與茱麗葉」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十一點半在講堂開始演出
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這位是我們羅密歐的扮演者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.05,0:02:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請可以拍張照嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請和我握個手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,文化祭這天的學校 有著和平常不同的風景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我卻覺得還有更不同的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一定是因為...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 期待你的「羅密歐與茱麗葉」哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.99,0:03:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你 我會加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 說了些奇怪的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有點慌張了 把我說的話忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這種 這種事...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真的很喜歡莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很可愛 很認真 很努力 還有點笨拙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吃鬆餅的時候也總是小口小口地吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鼻子上沾了奶油還是我提醒她才發現的 太可愛了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想看見莉莉難過
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 抱歉 就把那些話忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們要演出劇目「羅密歐與茱麗葉」歡迎觀賞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也許高崎同學一直都在勉強自己露出笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,「喜歡是什麼」喜歡到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不會吧 美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美奈 好久不見 還是這麼元氣十足呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕 這身衣服好帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.51,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是話劇的戲服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:56.04,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我完全沒發現是你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是和我一個初中的小柳同學
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的預備品清單 全都是錯的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是故意找麻煩嗎 還是看我不順眼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二年級的好像是這張
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別逗我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做衛生委員的時候犯了錯被她發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趁她發現我之前快跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:04:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,涼香 柊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了 柊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我們初中的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是根島 根島由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都一樣啊 都是島
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他也在這所學校嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這裡不都是一些成績好的學生嗎 真囂張
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼你這麼生氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那種女孩好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是不要和她有什麼關係比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,矢島先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是一個人偷偷跑出來玩了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那怎麼可能 我在工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這學校裡除了你還有不少人都是我負責的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為要視察所以休息日也得出來執勤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 之前你和我聊過的那個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,矢島先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼 還有事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 自從政府通知來了之後有件事一直很介意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那天晚上 我的政府通知到來的那天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的手機上顯示的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是高崎美咲同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好像說過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,難道不是你看錯了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也有這個可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但那到底是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使到現在我也時常會想起這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知是先做好書面材料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之後才會通過手機發送通知的 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 我會力所能及的範圍內幫你查一下的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這也算是為了在講習會說的那些話賠罪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 你也別抱太大希望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從結論上來說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的政府通知對像 就是 真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,演算的過程也確定過了 是沒錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 你註冊的政府通知服務那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有被介入修改過的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是說 是有人故意給我發送了那個通知嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不清楚 也不能排除是系統出錯的緣故
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:07:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這些都有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:00.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果真的是政府通知弄錯了 你要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了 我只是出於好奇才問的 別放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來 你和那女孩和好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你指的是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才我在校門口看見她了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼 要回去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不回去 我不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,門票都寄給我了 只是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有點緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是純情得讓我想笑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的 別笑話我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是你想的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再說了 今天 這樣真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:08:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你指什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話劇社今天有社團活動的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有紗你作為副社長翹班不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就因為我是副社長所以這不叫翹班哦 莉莉奈同學
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且既然莉莉奈小姐都拜託我了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪有不從命的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:20.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣嗎 那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有就是 我也想見見你的對象
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不是那麼有趣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是比我小一歲的普通男孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是要來見見能讓莉莉奈小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,露這幅表情的「普通男孩子」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 莉莉奈來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,難道她還在生氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,難得來一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜歡是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都不知道該如何面對她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之現在先把手上的傳單分發完
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,發完了再考慮那些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一年四班 十一點半在講堂演出話劇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歡迎前來觀賞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 話劇社 話劇社的展示在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話劇社在這棟樓的三樓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上了這個樓梯就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三樓 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.78,0:10:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以的話請來觀賞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了 等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然連話都不願意和我說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.55,0:11:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼回事啊 我還在緊張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一年四班 在講堂演出「羅密歐與茱麗葉」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十一點半開始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下來 一年五班將在十一點演出「白雪公主與七個紳士」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已經十一點了嗎 糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.55,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歡迎到講堂觀賞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 借過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你慌慌張張幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你現在要去試衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我還沒看過仁阪穿茱麗葉戲服的樣子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能一起去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:11:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.65,0:12:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要是看了的話我就殺了你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我不是連演出也看不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那真是太遺憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼能這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪還是老樣子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,發生什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好像有點奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:22.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過你一直都挺奇怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 暑假前我們吵架了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 是我惹她生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才突然偶遇她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她也完全不像以前那樣和我說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.11,0:12:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她果然還在生氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田同學 是特意來文化祭找你出氣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得應該不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你那麼努力 她是來看你的成果的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 提博爾特的劍哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仔細想想 整個班級一起進行的活動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天全部結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:17.34,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才小道具組的人還拿著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:19.49,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,開始緊張起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:23.04,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加藤同學 照明組的人員想問問第五幕的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能幫什麼忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道 你問問佐伯同學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佐伯同學
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 這不是勞倫斯神父的衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說過不是了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在 趕緊給我脫掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒錯 在這裡 脫到全裸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.17,0:13:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什麼能幫忙的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你把這個送到後台吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 那個箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:13:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒事 我來收拾吧 你去幫別人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 我能做什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我為文化祭做了些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 最後再對一遍台詞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,準備好的人就到後台來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪同學 剩下的你自己搞定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我先去後台了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪 你現在緊張嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不愧是仁阪啊 我就沒那麼輕鬆了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己明明沒有出場
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卻沒辦法冷靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總覺得這次文化祭我完全沒能派上用場
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事到如今 我卻感到有些後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:28.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是沒有那種盡了全力的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那種事大家都一樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畢竟也還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 我是因為你對我說的那些話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才開始融入集體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和班上的同學一起討論 一起思考
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還挺開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上次這樣和大家一起參與活動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能是小學的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得偶爾這樣也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.81,0:16:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為你想了很多 一直在激勵我前進
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.35,0:16:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是這樣想的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以你不用感到後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且你馬上會忘記後侮的心情的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我會讓你看看你當時說過的那個的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.87,0:16:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那份戀情並非是無意義的「證明」對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你這樣說過的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓我再說那麼羞恥的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且這些都是你的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可要負起責任好好看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那當然 我會睜大眼睛好好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小根
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這邊這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已經開始了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.41,0:17:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幕布剛剛拉上去 來的正好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一天 蒙太古家的羅密歐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,偷偷潛入了敵對的凱普萊特家族的宴會中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那裡遇見了自己命中注定之人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.15,0:17:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能邀您跳一支舞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十分樂意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概一生也忘不掉這場話劇了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,遇見你之後 我的人生變得亂七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的存在擾亂了我的心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每一次呼吸 我對你的思念都愈加深刻 痛苦不已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已經不能沒有你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而你卻不能屬於我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是如果沒有你 我將生不如死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回答我 茱麗葉 為什麼要這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是想留在他身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為了我最愛的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那時的我 已經忘記了後悔的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.85,0:20:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還想再看一遍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要怎麼跟仁阪打招呼才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要趕緊告訴她
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五十嵐同學
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 我就先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,送給你的 和高崎美咲的政府通知怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知 為什麼五十嵐同學會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不能告訴你為什麼我會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,難道是高崎同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這麼重要的事 美咲是不會告訴任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到今天的美咲 你有什麼感想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扮演羅密歐的美咲很帥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.93,0:21:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很帥 但是我覺得她今天漂亮得 怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彷彿隨時都會消失
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一定是因為 美咲犧牲了一切去戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從十五歲的那天起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.45,0:21:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎美咲才是你真正命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:27.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:29.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:31.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.77,0:22:34.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.05,0:22:36.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.34,0:22:38.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.77,0:22:40.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.91,0:22:43.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:46.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:52.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:56.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:59.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.43,0:23:05.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.76,0:23:07.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.59,0:23:10.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.05,0:23:14.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.75,0:23:16.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.35,0:23:34.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小春 為什麼你是小春呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你做什麼呢 竹田
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就當沒看見我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下集 傾盡一切的戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:42.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:49.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:56.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:01:01.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:09.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:15.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:22.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:30.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:37.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:42.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:50.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:56.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:27.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:31.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.05,0:22:36.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.34,0:22:38.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.77,0:22:40.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:52.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:59.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.43,0:23:05.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.59,0:23:10.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.05,0:23:14.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.75,0:23:16.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.35,0:23:34.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
